    bool "ESB link benchmark (throughput + RSSI)"
    depends on ZMK_ESB_ENDPOINT && SHELL
    default n if ZMK_ESB_ENDPOINT && SHELL
    help
      Adds 'esb bench' shell command. Run once to start the benchmark;
      run again after completion to read throughput and RSSI.

config ZMK_ESB_ENDPOINT_BENCH_DURATION_S
